:markdown
  The [first forty-nine paintings of *1-116*](/series/1-116/42/by_date)
  are collected in a book. It is an edition of nine copes,
  professionally printed, but hand-bound by the artist.

%img.bigpic{src: '/i/big/book.01.jpg', alt: '42%'}

:markdown
  A unique *Forty-Two Percent, Teacher's Edition* was produced, which
  has an appendix explaining the ideas behind each painting. This is
  sold, and no more copies will be made.

%img.bigpic{src: '/i/big/book.02.jpg', alt: '42%'}

:markdown
  *Forty-Two Percent* may be [downloaded as a (21Mb) PDF
  file](/downloads/forty-two_percent.pdf).
